# This repo is consumed by Linux tooling (Docker image, gunicorn, the mailctl
# CLI shebang). All text files MUST keep LF line endings regardless of the
# committer's core.autocrlf setting — a CRLF in a shebang breaks the script
# ("#!/usr/bin/env python3\r": no such file), and on WSL2 autocrlf will mangle
# files on checkout without this.
#
# Catch-all first: every text file is LF. `text=auto` leaves real binaries alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.sql   text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.ini   text eol=lf
*.cfg   text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Makefile   text eol=lf
